			"text": "\"Ilse Marrow. Everything I know that's worth knowing, she taught me, mostly by shouting.\" Zora's smile doesn't move. \"The Order took her notebook at the burning. That inquisitor on the south road carries it like a prayer book; he quotes it at the people he's about to hang. I want it back. I won't ask how.\"",
